    "replay": {
      "prefabs": "From the repository root, load docs/research/evidence/forced-motion-20261118/push/extract_push_config.py using runpy.run_path and call extract_with('extract_prefabs.py', output_path, SELECTION=provenance.prefabs.selection). Match selected result rows by bundle, file and pathId, then project the recorded fields. Parse the serialized Chant action array as JSON.",
      "template": "Use the same extract_with helper with ('extract_templates.py', output_path, KEYS={'switch_mode_restart_fsm'}). For PersistentData, read the identified holder object with native-research unity_assets Reader starting at byte 28. Read a holder name and record count, then each record's three fields (key, effect, priority), and each event's three fields (event, program JSON, object reference count followed by 12 bytes per reference). Match the recorded key, relative offset and record hash.",
      "tables": "Use read_table from the same helper to check the pinned hashes and select character.skills[characterSkillSlot] and the distinct skill.levels[*].prefabId values."
    },
